msgstr "正在恢复 {}"

msgid "Test complete"
msgstr "测试完成"

msgid "Test failed"
msgstr "测试失败"

msgid "Testing {}"
msgstr "正在测试 {}"

msgid "Extraction complete"
msgstr "解压完成"

msgid "Extraction paused"
msgstr "解压已暂停"

msgid "Extraction failed"
msgstr "解压失败"

msgid "Insufficient disk space"
msgstr "磁盘空间不足"

msgid "Extracting {}"
msgstr "正在解压 {}"

msgid "Checking disk space…"
msgstr "正在检查磁盘空间…"

msgid "Converting it back to a standard archive. Extracted files are kept."
msgstr "正在将其恢复为标准压缩包。已解压的文件会保留。"

msgid "Verifying every entry. No files are written."
msgstr "正在校验每个条目。不会写入任何文件。"

msgid "Pausing after the current batch…"
msgstr "将在当前批次完成后暂停…"

msgid "Verifying archive before extracting…"
msgstr "解压前正在校验压缩包…"

msgid "Progress is saved. The extraction can be resumed now or later."
msgstr "进度已保存。可以立即或稍后继续解压。"

msgid "All entries were extracted. The archive was kept."
msgstr "所有条目均已解压。压缩包已保留。"

msgid "All entries were extracted. The archive was removed."
msgstr "所有条目均已解压。压缩包已删除。"

msgid "Test passed: 1 entry verified."
msgid_plural "Test passed: {} entries verified."
msgstr[0] "测试通过：已校验 {} 个条目。"

msgid "'{}' already exists in {}."
msgstr "{1} 中已存在“{0}”。"

msgid "Replace deletes the existing file when the extraction completes. Skip keeps it, and the archive's copy is not kept. Keep both keeps it and adds the archive's copy with a number after its name."
msgstr "“替换”会在解压完成时删除现有文件。“跳过”会保留现有文件，但不保留压缩包中的副本。“保留两者”会保留现有文件，同时添加压缩包中的副本，并在其名称后加上编号。"

msgid "Replace deletes the existing file when the extraction completes. Skip keeps it. Keep both keeps it and adds the archive's copy with a number after its name."
msgstr "“替换”会在解压完成时删除现有文件。“跳过”会保留现有文件。“保留两者”会保留现有文件，同时添加压缩包中的副本，并在其名称后加上编号。"

msgid "Do the same for the next file"
msgid_plural "Do the same for the next {} files"
msgstr[0] "对接下来的 {} 个文件执行相同操作"

msgid "Destination: {}"
msgstr "目标位置：{}"

msgid "{} of {}"
msgstr "{0} / {1}"

msgid "Archive remaining: {}"
msgstr "压缩包剩余：{}"

msgid "Waiting for disk"
msgstr "正在等待磁盘"

msgid "{}/s, {} remaining"
msgstr "{}/秒，剩余 {}"

msgid "less than 5 seconds"
msgstr "不到 5 秒"

msgid "{} second"
msgid_plural "{} seconds"
msgstr[0] "{} 秒"

msgid "{} minute"
msgid_plural "{} minutes"
msgstr[0] "{} 分钟"

msgid "{} hour"
msgid_plural "{} hours"
msgstr[0] "{} 小时"

msgid "the 1 entry"
msgid_plural "the {} entries"
msgstr[0] "{} 个条目"

msgid "Extraction progress discarded. The archive was not modified. Extracted files remain in {}."
msgstr "已放弃解压进度。压缩包未被修改。已解压的文件仍保留在 {} 中。"

msgid "Archive restored. It contains {} not yet extracted. Extracted files remain in {}."
msgstr "压缩包已恢复，其中有 {}尚未解压。已解压的文件仍保留在 {} 中。"

msgid "1 replaced file remains in {1}, since the file extracted at its path is no longer in the archive."
msgid_plural "{} replaced files remain in {}, since the files extracted at their paths are no longer in the archive."
msgstr[0] "{0} 个被替换的文件仍保留在 {1} 中，因为在其路径上解压出的文件已不在压缩包中。"

msgid "link"
msgstr "链接"

msgid "{} Progress is saved; the extraction can be resumed."
msgstr "{} 进度已保存，可以继续解压。"

msgid "Folder"
msgstr "文件夹"

msgid "Link"
msgstr "链接"

msgid "{}. Turn off \"Remove the archive during extraction\" to extract it and keep the archive."
msgstr "{}。关闭“解压时逐步删除压缩包”即可解压并保留压缩包。"

msgid "Sufficient disk space"
msgstr "磁盘空间充足"

msgid "Insufficient disk space. {} more is required."
msgstr "磁盘空间不足，还需要 {}。"

msgid "Removing the archive during extraction requires only {}."
msgstr "解压时逐步删除压缩包仅需 {}。"

msgid "There is also enough space to keep the archive."
msgstr "空间也足够保留压缩包。"

msgid "Most of the required space is one solid block, which can only be released after it is fully extracted."
msgstr "所需空间大部分用于一个固实块，只有将其完全解压后才能释放。"

msgid "The destination is on another drive, so removing the archive does not free space there."
msgstr "目标位置在其他磁盘上，删除压缩包不会释放目标磁盘的空间。"

msgid "This drive cannot release space inside a file, so the compressed archive remains whole until extraction completes."
msgstr "此磁盘无法释放文件内部的空间，因此压缩包将完整保留到解压结束。"

msgid "Extract with {} reserved"
msgstr "预留 {} 并解压"

msgid "Extract without a reserve"
msgstr "不预留空间直接解压"

msgid "The reserve is all that stands in the way: {} is needed and {} is available, so it can run with {} reserved, with {} left once it finishes."
msgstr "唯一的障碍是预留空间：需要 {}，可用 {}，因此可以预留 {} 运行，完成后剩余 {}。"

msgid "The reserve is all that stands in the way: {} is needed and {} is available, so it can run without one, with {} left once it finishes."
msgstr "唯一的障碍是预留空间：需要 {}，可用 {}，因此可以不预留空间运行，完成后剩余 {}。"

msgid "Available: {}. Required: {}, plus {} reserved."
msgstr "可用空间：{}。所需空间：{}，另需预留 {}。"

msgid "Settings…"
msgstr "设置…"

msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

msgid "Extraction"
msgstr "解压"

msgid "Integration"
msgstr "系统集成"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

msgid "System follows the light or dark setting of the operating system."
msgstr "“跟随系统”会使用操作系统的浅色或深色设置。"

msgid "System"
msgstr "跟随系统"

msgid "Light"
msgstr "浅色"

msgid "Dark"
msgstr "深色"

msgid "After extracting"
msgstr "解压完成后"

msgid "The destination folder opens in the file manager when an extraction completes."
msgstr "解压完成后，在文件管理器中打开目标文件夹。"

msgid "The result is shown in the window and nothing else is opened."
msgstr "结果显示在窗口中，不会打开其他内容。"

msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "不执行任何操作"

msgid "Open the folder"
msgstr "打开文件夹"

msgid "Applies to the window the right-click menu opens. A test, a pause or a failure keeps it open."
msgstr "适用于从右键菜单打开的窗口。测试、暂停或失败时，窗口会保持打开。"

msgid "Every entry is read and checked before anything is extracted or removed, which takes longer."
msgstr "在解压或删除任何内容之前，先读取并校验每个条目，耗时更长。"

msgid "Free space left untouched on the destination drive, so the system and other programs keep room to work."
msgstr "在目标磁盘上保留不动的可用空间，让系统和其他程序仍有空间可用。"

msgid "Default destination"
msgstr "默认目标位置"

msgid "Each archive is extracted into a folder named after it inside the chosen folder. \"Extract here\" in the right-click menu still extracts next to the archive."
msgstr "每个压缩包都会解压到所选文件夹中以其名称命名的文件夹里。右键菜单中的“Extract here”仍会解压到压缩包旁边。"

msgid "Each archive is extracted into a folder named after it, next to the archive."
msgstr "每个压缩包都会解压到它旁边以其名称命名的文件夹中。"

msgid "Next to the archive"
msgstr "压缩包旁边"

msgid "Always in a folder"
msgstr "始终放在指定文件夹"

msgid "No folder chosen"
msgstr "未选择文件夹"

msgid "When a file already exists"
msgstr "文件已存在时"

msgid "Existing files are replaced. The old copies are kept until the extraction completes, then deleted."
msgstr "现有文件会被替换。旧副本会保留到解压完成，然后删除。"

msgid "Existing files are kept, and the archive's copies of them are not."
msgstr "保留现有文件，不保留压缩包中的副本。"

msgid "Each file already in the destination is shown, with the choice to replace it, skip it or keep both."
msgstr "逐一显示目标位置中已有的文件，可选择替换、跳过或保留两者。"

msgid "Ask"
msgstr "询问"

msgid "Adds HatchZip's extract and test entries to the right-click menu of archives."
msgstr "在压缩包的右键菜单中添加 HatchZip 的解压和测试菜单项。"

msgid "Settings file"
msgstr "设置文件"

msgid "Settings are saved here as soon as they change."
msgstr "设置一经更改，就会立即保存到这里。"

msgid "Show in Explorer"
msgstr "在文件资源管理器中显示"

msgid "Show in Finder"
msgstr "在“访达”中显示"

msgid "Show in the file manager"
msgstr "在文件管理器中显示"

msgid "Reset all settings"
msgstr "重置所有设置"

msgid "Every setting returns to its default, including the language and the appearance."
msgstr "所有设置都会恢复默认值，包括语言和外观。"

msgid "Reset all settings…"
msgstr "重置所有设置…"

msgid "Reset all settings?"
msgstr "要重置所有设置吗？"

msgid "The language, the appearance and every extraction setting return to their defaults. The right-click menu is not changed."
msgstr "语言、外观和所有解压设置都将恢复默认值。右键菜单不会改变。"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

msgid "Select the default destination folder"
msgstr "选择默认目标文件夹"
